# below with ciphertext and writes the private key to `.env.keys`, which is
# gitignored and lives only on the server. See DEPLOY.md step 4.
#
# BACK THE KEY UP outside the repo. It is gitignored, so `git status` never
# shows it and any sweep of ignored files deletes it silently.
